menu "Hubo hardware bring-up"
    config HUBO_HW_PROBE
        bool "Run the GNSS board bring-up probe at boot (debug builds only)"
        default n
        help
            After the mesh task starts, powers the GNSS (GPS_EN_N low), tries to talk to it over
            UART1 (GPIO20 RX / GPIO21 TX) and stores the result in the global g_hw_probe, which a
            JTAG debugger reads. Not for release builds.
endmenu
